        "output": "1 1\n5 4 2 2",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nNote: The above test case belongs to subtask 2.\nLet ⊕\\oplus⊕ denote the bitwise XOR operation.\n\n\nTest Case 1: A=[1,1]A = [1, 1]A=[1,1] satisfies all the conditions since [1,0,1]=[1,1⊕1,1][1, 0, 1] = [1, 1 \\oplus 1, 1][1,0,1]=[1,1⊕1,1]\n\n\nTest Case 2: A=[5,4,2,2]A = [5, 4, 2, 2]A=[5,4,2,2] satisfies all the conditions since [5,3,1,4,3]=[5⊕2⊕2,5⊕4⊕2,5⊕4⊕2⊕2,4⊕2⊕2,5⊕4⊕2][5, 3, 1, 4, 3] = [5 \\oplus 2 \\oplus 2, 5 \\oplus 4 \\oplus 2, 5 \\oplus 4 \\oplus 2 \\oplus 2, 4 \\oplus 2 \\oplus 2, 5 \\oplus 4 \\oplus 2][5,3,1,4,3]=[5⊕2⊕2,5⊕4⊕2,5⊕4⊕2⊕2,4⊕2⊕2,5⊕4⊕2]"
